/agricultural-submersible-pump50541770797.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Agricultural Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>We manufacture agricultural submersible pumps and sell them to many countries in South Asia, South America and so forth. Our submersible pumps are widely used in not only agricultural areas but also facility constructions and have won a lot of praise from many...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52168679\"/></p><p><strong>agricultural submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241142503899567.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We manufacture agricultural submersible pumps and sell them to many countries in South Asia, South America and so forth. Our submersible pumps are widely used in not only agricultural areas but also facility constructions and have won a lot of praise from many customers.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter(specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Horsepower (HP)</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">4-30</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">RPM</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">2850</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Warranty</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Twelve moths</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Volts</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">220-240/380-415V~50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Insulation class</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">F</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Impeller Material</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Plastic</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">1169-2701 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Shaft Dia</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">19mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Application</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Agricultural irrigation, urban, industrial and mining enterprises of water supply, plateaus, mountains of pressurized water supply of water for people and livestock and high-rise buildings.</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Package</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Wood or Carton (with or without plastic foam)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Power Source</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Submersible</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Yes</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Max Head</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">325m</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241144369391635.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241142467923731.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image011.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241145068985576.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>4. Operating Conditions</p><p>Maximum fluid temperature up to +35Cº</p><p>Maximum sand content:0.25%</p><p>Maximum immersion:90m</p><p>Minimum well diameter:4\"</p><p><strong>5. Company Information</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241145536319478.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>Established in 1998, our company has been selling products to many countries like India, Russia, Vietnam and so forth. The main products of our company are various sizes of submersible pumps like screw submersible pump, multistage pumps. <br/></p><p>We desire to become your supplier!</p><p><strong>6. Why Choose Us</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241146338807315.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>1. Tight sealing</strong></p><p>With optimized design, the seal system is safe and reliable, preventing leakage of fluids inside and outside the motor.</p><p><strong>2. Hard and durable</strong></p><p>JIADI 6SRm27 series submersible pump has hard and durable cast iron body, which has been processed with advanced technology to prevent corrosion.</p><p><strong>3.Convenient to use</strong></p><p>JIADI submersible pump has simple and proper structure, easy and convenient to install and use.</p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909571261840.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240910014421578.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p>It is of great importance that our products have met the highest quality requirements as stipulated in ISO 9001: 2008, CE, GS, SON, RoHS, PAHS, SNI, etc guidelines and our stringent quality control system, which attracts people to buy our pump.</p><p><strong>8. Exhibition Show</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241148171256277.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image021(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>9. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241148227988776.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image023(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Packaging Details：Carton packing with plastic foam/Wooden box</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Shanghai, Lianyungang</p><p>Time: 20 to 30 days</p><p>Delivery methods: By sea and by express delivery</p><p>Supply Capability: 100,000 Pieces/ Month</p><p><strong>10. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about the warranty of your products?</strong></p><p>A: We offer 12 months warranty.</p><p><strong>2. Are you a manufactory or trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are water pump manufactory with more than 20 years production experience of submersible water pumps.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Under what circumstance do I need to install a pump?</strong></p><p>A: If you want to have good tap water pressure, than a pump is required. In most cases a pump is the better option.</p><p><strong>4. How can I connect with you?</strong></p><p>A: Leave message freely through Email and we will reply ASAP.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: agricultural submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-screw-pump\"><img alt=\"2.5 Inch Submersible Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/2-5-inch-submersible-screw-pump294